WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.925
In cartoons, you could run off a cliff and keep going, as long as you didn't look down.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.275
You could be flattened by a piano and stand up in the next scene.

3
00:00:13.275 --> 00:00:18.025
You could lose every single chase and be back again next week.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.425
We thought they were teaching us that nothing hurts.

5
00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:26.450
But maybe they were teaching us something else.

6
00:00:27.475 --> 00:00:30.125
Falling isn't the end of the story.

7
00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:33.850
It's just the part before the next scene.

8
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:35.950
Get up.

9
00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:39.075
The music's still playing.
